+DRM DRIVER FOR GOOGLE TG4C PANELS
+M:	W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/google,tg4c.yaml
